            {
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "flag": "meeting_fate",
                        "equals": "minuted"
                    }
                ],
                "once": true,
                "text": "\"Written down. Like the lamp book: every night, lit, trimmed, out.\" He considers it. \"Nobody's ever read the lamp book.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Leave them to it.",
                        "end": true
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "flag": "meeting_fate",
                        "equals": "subscribed"
                    }
                ],
                "once": true,
                "text": "\"One of the owners, they're saying.\" He touches the lamp post. \"Then you'll keep these lit. Keep to the street after dark, owner.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Leave them to it.",
                        "end": true
